    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "盘状双层胶束(bicelles)可用于模拟生物膜,研究膜蛋白与脂双层膜的相互作用。盘状双层胶束是扁平状的,厚度约为40 Å,直径约为400\\~600 Å。单一脂质在水环境中可形成双层胶束,形成的原理非常简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "向 DMPE 中加入缓冲液,振荡过夜,可制得盘状双层胶束。假设 DMPE 的 pK_{a1}=1.0,\\quad pK_{a2}=9.0 。"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1,2-Dimyristoyl-sn-glycero-3-phosphoethanolamine (DMPE)"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "data/stems/assets/problem-000233-figure-001.jpg",
      "assetId": "asset-003253",
      "alt": "原卷示意图：1,2-Dimyristoyl-sn-glycero-3-phosphoethanolamine (DMPE)",
      "label": "1,2-Dimyristoyl-sn-glycero-3-phosphoethanolamine (DMPE)",
      "caption": "1,2-Dimyristoyl-sn-glycero-3-phosphoethanolamine (DMPE)",
      "displayWidth": 100
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "src": "data/stems/assets/problem-000233-figure-002.jpg",
      "assetId": "asset-003254",
      "alt": "原卷示意图：盘状双层胶束",
      "label": "盘状双层胶束",
      "caption": "盘状双层胶束",
      "displayWidth": 100
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "盘状双层胶束"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "4-1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "若每个盘状双层胶束中含有 1000 个 DMPE 分子。计算此胶束分别在 pH 为 9.0 和 7.0 时所带的电荷数 (以电子电量 e− 为单位)。"
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-001297"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "4-2",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "计算此胶束所带电荷小于 1 个电子电量时的 pH 范围。"
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-001298"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "4-3",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "列出与盘状双层胶束形状形成相关的作用力。"
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-001299"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4- 4 将 \\mathrm{pH} 值提高到9.0以上, 盘状双层胶束的形状将如何转变方向 并给出你的理由。"
    }
  ],
